<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Uniphase Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Uniphase Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group said analyst Kevin Slocum upgraded Uniphase Corp's long-term rating to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said the short-term rating remains unchanged at buy.</p>
<p>-- said earnings estimates of $0.90 a share for fiscal 1997 and $1.40 a share for fiscal 1998 are unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Uniphase lost 1-1/2 to 34 in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
